@host = http://localhost:9081

# adminToken : POST /bank/auth/login (docs/bank-security.http). walletToken : Keycloak, même fichier.

### Créer un agent
POST {{host}}/bank/admin/agents
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "agent2",
  "password": "agent12345",
  "firstName": "Claire",
  "lastName": "Agent",
  "email": "agent2@bank.local",
  "role": "BANK_ADMIN"
}

### Lister les agents
GET {{host}}/bank/admin/agents
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Créer un client
POST {{host}}/bank/admin/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Amina",
  "lastName": "Kabila",
  "phone": "243810000001",
  "email": "amina.kabila@example.com"
}

### Lire un client
GET {{host}}/bank/admin/customers/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Rechercher des clients
GET {{host}}/bank/admin/customers?search=kabila&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Ouvrir un compte
POST {{host}}/bank/admin/customers/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Comptes d'un client
GET {{host}}/bank/admin/customers/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Dépôt administrateur
POST {{host}}/bank/admin/accounts/000000000000/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": "100000.00"
}

### Bloquer un compte
POST {{host}}/bank/admin/accounts/000000000000/block
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Débloquer un compte
POST {{host}}/bank/admin/accounts/000000000000/unblock
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Clôturer un compte
POST {{host}}/bank/admin/accounts/000000000000/close
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Suspendre un client
POST {{host}}/bank/admin/customers/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/suspend
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Réactiver un client
POST {{host}}/bank/admin/customers/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/reactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Historique d'un compte
GET {{host}}/bank/admin/accounts/000000000000/operations?type=DEBIT&status=SUCCESS&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Journal d'audit
GET {{host}}/bank/admin/audit?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Débit
POST {{host}}/bank/operations/debit
Authorization: Bearer {{walletToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reference": "debit-exemple-1",
  "accountNumber": "000000000000",
  "amount": "30000.00"
}

### Crédit
POST {{host}}/bank/operations/credit
Authorization: Bearer {{walletToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reference": "credit-exemple-1",
  "accountNumber": "000000000000",
  "amount": "5000.00"
}

### Lire une opération
GET {{host}}/bank/operations/debit-exemple-1
Authorization: Bearer {{walletToken}}

### Lire un compte
GET {{host}}/bank/accounts/000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{walletToken}}

### Vérifier une liaison
POST {{host}}/bank/links/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{walletToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountNumber": "000000000000",
  "phone": "243810000001"
}
